8,689],{},"v.file",", ",[316,692,693],{},"v.mimeType"," and ",[316,696,697],{},"v.maxSize"," for required, type and size checks; see ",[341,700,702],{"href":701},"\u002Fcomponents\u002Fphone-file\u002Ffile#with-form-validation","With form validation"," on the File page.",[705,706,707,708,425],"note",{},"Dates and options are currently only checked for being required. Add rules for date formats, whether an option is still valid, cross-field conditions, numeric ranges and so on as needed, for example ",[316,709,710],{},"v.pipe(v.number(), v.minValue(1), v.maxValue(100))",[333,712,714],{"id":713},"empty-values-and-types","Empty values and types",[312,716,717,718,721,722,725,726,729,730,732,733,736,737,741,742,745,746,694,749,752,753,755],{},"Components write ",[316,719,720],{},"null"," \u002F ",[316,723,724],{},"undefined"," bound by the parent back as the agreed empty value (",[316,727,728],{},"''"," for text, ",[316,731,720],{}," for numbers, ",[316,734,735],{},"[]"," for date ranges and so on; see ",[341,738,740],{"href":739},"\u002Fcomponents\u002Foverview\u002Fcommon#empty-values","Empty values","). Unexpected values are cleared, and most components also log a ",[316,743,744],{},"console.warn"," (",[316,747,748],{},"ShuoSelectMenu",[316,750,751],{},"ShuoMonths"," only clear without warning; see the same section). An unselected radio group is ",[316,754,728],{},", so options should not use an empty string as their value.",[312,757,758,759,721,761,763,764,690,767,770],{},"The input types of the shared schemas accept ",[316,760,720],{},[316,762,724],{}," while editing, and the output after validation narrows to ",[316,765,766],{},"string",[316,768,769],{},"number"," or an array of the item type, so you do not need to change the components' empty-value contract.",[333,772,774],{"id":773},"display-and-interaction","Display and interaction",[776,777,778,786,804],"ul",{},[779,780,781,782,785],"li",{},"We recommend the built-in theme (",[316,783,784],{},"theme: true",") for error messages: a floating style inset in the field's bottom border that does not add to the field height. Keep enough spacing between fields, and avoid clipping overflowing content in the containers.",[779,787,788,791,792,795,796,799,800,803],{},[316,789,790],{},"UForm"," only fires ",[316,793,794],{},"@submit"," after validation passes; read the validated data from ",[316,797,798],{},"event.data",". When validation fails, ",[316,801,802],{},"@error"," fires.",[779,805,806,807,810],{},"Use the default validation timing on input, blur and change. When resetting, besides clearing the state, call the form's ",[316,808,809],{},"clear()"," to clear the errors.",[812,813,814],"style",{},"html pre.shiki code .s7zQu, html code.shiki .s7zQu{--shiki-light:#39ADB5;--shiki-light-font-style:italic;--shiki-default:#89DDFF;--shiki-default-font-style:italic;--shiki-dark:#89DDFF;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic}html pre.shiki code .sMK4o, html code.shiki .sMK4o{--shiki-light:#39ADB5;--shiki-default:#89DDFF;--shiki-dark:#89DDFF}html pre.shiki code .sTEyZ, html code.shiki .sTEyZ{--shiki-light:#90A4AE;--shiki-default:#EEFFFF;--shiki-dark:#BABED8}html pre.shiki code .sfazB, html code.shiki .sfazB{--shiki-light:#91B859;--shiki-default:#C3E88D;--shiki-dark:#C3E88D}html pre.shiki code .spNyl, html code.shiki .spNyl{--shiki-light:#9C3EDA;--shiki-default:#C792EA;--shiki-dark:#C792EA}html pre.shiki code .s2Zo4, html code.shiki .s2Zo4{--shiki-light:#6182B8;--shiki-default:#82AAFF;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF}html pre.shiki code .swJcz, html code.shiki .swJcz{--shiki-light:#E53935;--shiki-default:#F07178;--shiki-dark:#F07178}html .light .shiki span {color: var(--shiki-light);background: var(--shiki-light-bg);font-style: var(--shiki-light-font-style);font-weight: var(--shiki-light-font-weight);text-decoration: var(--shiki-light-text-decoration);}html.light .shiki span {color: var(--shiki-light);background: var(--shiki-light-bg);font-style: var(--shiki-light-font-style);font-weight: var(--shiki-light-f